"alt":"A range-sum query after some range updates, on a six-value lazy tree. The query descends from the root. A node partly inside the range first pushes its pending tag to its two children, adding the tag times the child's length to each child's sum, so that the children can be trusted. Nodes outside return zero and nodes inside return their sum. The presets show two updates stacked on one node, a pending tag the query never touches, and a tag pushed through two levels.",
"legendLabels":{"current":"Inside, sum read","compare":"Partly inside","invalid":"Outside the range","path":"Received pushed tag"},
